WEBVTT

00:02:28.418 --> 00:02:31.250
and it was like a light bulb went off for everybody in the place.

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:33.958
Because finally there was a page

00:02:33.958 --> 00:02:37.159
that actually felt like what it felt like to hit a 404.

00:02:37.159 --> 00:02:38.685
(Laughter)

00:02:38.685 --> 00:02:40.466
(Applause)

00:02:40.466 --> 00:02:42.833
So this turned into a contest.

00:02:42.833 --> 00:02:45.083
Dailypath that offers inspiration

00:02:45.083 --> 00:02:47.579
put inspiration on their 404 page.

00:02:47.579 --> 00:02:51.495
Stayhound, which helps you find pet sitters through your social network,

00:02:51.495 --> 00:02:53.315
commiserated with your pet.

00:02:53.315 --> 00:02:54.708
Each one of them found this.

00:02:54.708 --> 00:02:55.958
It turned into a 24-hour contest.

00:02:55.958 --> 00:02:59.083
At 4:04 the next day, we gave out $404 in cash.

00:02:59.083 --> 00:03:00.500
And what they learned